OL,3,ABurnham leaves door open to referendum
OL,4,Aon EU free movement
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister has left the door
OL,7,Fopen to a potential referendum on
OL,8,Ffreedom of movement with the European
OL,9,FUnion.
OL,11,FAsked by broadcasters if he could
OL,12,Fintroduce free movement without a
OL,13,Freferendum, Andy Burnham said "no", but
OL,14,Fsources told the BBC no decision on
OL,15,Fthat has been made.
OL,17,FHe added that he would "never move
OL,18,Fahead of the British public when it
OL,19,Fcomes to Brexit".
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
