OL,3,ABurnham leaves door open to referendum
OL,4,Aon EU free movement
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham has ruled out major changes to
OL,7,Fthe UK's relationship with the EU
OL,8,Fbefore the next general election but
OL,9,Fsays he wants start a conversation
OL,10,Fabout potential options, with these
OL,11,Fexpected to be set out around the time
OL,12,Fof the EU summit next month.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
